nion continues to display it in violation of FCRA 1681i and 605B, both of which require blocking or deletion of unverifiable or identity-theft-related accounts.

Account XXXX XXXX  ( {$140.00} ) : This alleged account is reporting solely on Equifax. It too remains unverified, continues to be published without substantiation, and constitutes an unlawful reinsertion or continuation of inaccurate data in violation of the same statutory protections. 

