These actions materially interfere with my rights under FCRA to access, dispute, and correct my consumer information. 

Illegal Deletion of Positive PaidOff Auto Loans XXXX XXXX XXXX ( Account No. XXXX ) : This was a legitimate, paidoff auto loan with a balance of {$43000.00}. It was deleted from my credit reports without cause. 

